  "body": "## Change\n\nImplement option 2 of #3476. Keep kind-tagged parameter patches refused.\n\nFor one matching kind wrapper, the refusal includes `Corrected call: edit_operation ` followed by usable JSON arguments. The suggestion preserves the requested operation name and every inner patch value. The existing patch parser and edit-command checks must accept it first. The refusal does not execute the command.\n\nFlat edits, unknown fields, mismatched kinds and invalid values retain their existing handling. The tests cover retry, undo/redo, escaped names, nested fields, null removal and invalid inputs.\n\nUpdate only the `edit_operation` row in the MCP skill. Record the diagnostic-only decision in `docs/decisions/3476-nested-params-guidance.md`. No accepted input shape or machining semantics change.\n\n## Sources and scope\n\nRead #3476 and its full thread, root/UI instructions, the ownership procedure and #681 through comment7230708194. Root rules govern the process-version handling. The #4384 clarification preserves outside-contributor fork PRs and manual maintainer handling.\n\nThe branch starts at upstream main `3c7cbe86056cdf306c7bfa6909bc7d5d94088542` (PROCESS_VERSION 166). This is not a fork-main product sync. Current upstream main `2394b5ad1efc573b7b99a898a02cc4225b4d9893` has unchanged applicable instructions and affected source files. No refresh was made.\n\nWriter record: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/3476#issuecomment-7231422592\n\n## Checks\n\nAll implementation checks below ran independently on exact head `a22cd58fa620a0f8bcdd3597cc24ff5a57cebff3`.\n\n- RED: At regression-only commit `47d04d1d195c1fd16681aaa618cf80c21ddceffe`, `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test mcp_enum_patch nested_job_params_refusal_supplies_a_usable_flat_call -- --ignored --exact` ran one test. It failed only at the required corrected-call assertion (exit101). It was not skipped or blocked by setup.\n- GREEN: At the implementation head, the same command without `--ignored` passed: one test, zero failed or ignored.\n- The quick plan, `cargo xtask gate quick --base 3c7cbe86056cdf306c7bfa6909bc7d5d94088542 --dry-run`, selected 25 integration suites plus the app library. The plan alone is not test evidence. All selected suites then ran through `cargo test -p camcraft-app`, in these two groups, with `--test-threads=1`:\n  - `--lib --test bore_core --test drill_undersize --test drilling_detect_mill_radial --test hole_feed_rating --test mcp_enum_patch --test mcp_part_kerf --test mcp_plasma --test mcp_waterjet`: PASS, including all six enum-patch tests and 329 library tests.\n  - `--test adaptive_trochoid --test clearance_in_stock --test contour_start_point --test deburr_chord_width --test deburr_unreachable --test equal_steps --test face_pass_start --test face_start_exit --test mcp_deburr --test mcp_multiaxis_deburr --test mcp_rotary_flow --test mcp_wire_contour --test pocket3d_trochoid --test predrilled_entry --test slot_extension --test slot_picks --test slot_start_exit`: PASS.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test mcp_doc_drift -- --test-threads=1`: PASS, nine tests.\n- Light lane: PASS at the same head, all eleven selected twins across five steps. `cargo xtask gate light --only 'motion light:' --only 'app light:'` completed the four motion steps. Its first run timed out during app compilation, not a test failure. `cargo xtask gate light --only 'app light: pocket_pass_start'` then completed the remaining app twin successfully. No incomplete step is counted as passed.\n- `git diff --check`: PASS. Tracked content, head and clean tracked/untracked status remained unchanged through the checks.\n\nThe runs used Cargo/rustc1.100.0 with `CAMCRAFT_NO_SEED=1 CAMCRAFT_GATE_SWEEP=off CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=1 CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=1 CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=1 CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0`.\n\n## Limits\n\nNo post, geometry, simulation, machine, toolpath, dependency, lockfile, toolchain or UI changes. No new test binary. No full heavy/release gate, UI render or physical-machine test ran. No clippy result is claimed. CI is not claimed as green; these are local test results. This draft awaits final review and manual upstream handling. It must not merge during the current merge freeze.\n\nEffort: medium\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: MCP edit_operation refusals give a validated flat retry call for matching kind-tagged parameter patches.\n\nFixes #3476\n",
